  "prefLabel": "Ncr 1103.03 Special Concern Species",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 1103.03 Special Concern Species.\n\n(a) The natural heritage inventory of special concern species shall contain any native species not meeting the requirements for Ncr 1103.01 or Ncr 1103.02 and which are vulnerable to collection without landowner consent due to their showy nature or require monitoring to assure that excessive collecting or other taking does not result in the need to add any species to the inventory of threatened or endangered species.\n\n(b) Any plant found to comply with (a) above, for which a petition conforming with Res 202.01 and Ncr 1104 has been submitted, shall be added to the natural heritage inventory.\n\nSource. #5927, eff 11-22-94, EXPIRED: 11-22-00\n\nNew. #7507, eff 6-21-01; ss by #9479, eff 6-1-09, EXPIRED: 6-1-17\n\nNew. #12825, INTERIM, eff 7-10-19, EXPIRES: 1-6-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ncr1100.html"
